{"s":[[null,1,[["p",["Foraging is the ",["l","技能","skill"]," associated with gathering wild resources found on the ground throughout Stardew Valley, and with chopping down ",["l","树","Trees"],". Foraging skill also increases by harvesting crops grown from ",["l","农作物","Wild Seeds"],"."]],["p",["Most forageables can be found throughout their season. One exception is ",["l","美洲大树莓","Salmonberry"],", which can be found only during Salmonberry Season (",["l","春季","Spring"]," 15-18) on bushes around town. Blackberries can be found on the ground during ",["l","秋季","Fall"],", but during Blackberry Season (",["l","秋季","Fall"]," 8-11) they can also be found on bushes throughout town."]]]],["Quality",2,[["p",["The quality of foraged goods comes in four levels: regular, silver, gold, and iridium. However, only players who have chosen the Botanist Profession can find iridium-quality foraged goods. Higher quality goods command higher prices when the goods are sold, and deliver greater ",["l","能量","energy"]," and ",["l","生命值","health"]," benefits when they are consumed. If given as a gift to an NPC who likes or loves it, a quality gift also provides a higher number of ",["l","友谊","friendship"]," points."]],["p",["The ",["f","Botanist.png",24]," ",["l","采集","Botanist profession"]," applies iridium quality to:"]],["l",0,[[1,["All items labeled as \"Forage\" in-game (except ",["l","树液","Sap"]," and ",["l","山洞萝卜","Cave Carrot"],", and buried items)"]],[1,[["l","水果","Fruits"],", ",["l","蔬菜","vegetables"],", and ",["l","花","flowers"]," found as forage (including ",["l","美洲大树莓","Salmonberries"]," and ",["l","黑莓","Blackberries"]," shaken from bushes during their respective seasons)"]],[1,[["l","椰子","Coconut"],"s shaken from ",["l","棕榈树","Palm Tree"],"s"]],[1,["Fruit left by fruit bats in ",["l","山洞","the cave"],", provided the player chose that option when prompted by ",["l","德米特里厄斯","Demetrius"]," (mushrooms are not affected)"]],[1,["All items foraged from ",["l","沙滩","the beach"]," except for ",["l","海草","Seaweed"]]],[1,["Crops grown from ",["l","农作物","Wild Seeds"]]],[1,[["l","松露","Truffle"],"s"]]]],["p",["The Botanist profession does not apply iridium quality in these cases:"]],["l",0,[[1,["Mushrooms that are not picked up from the ground. Notably, this includes mushrooms gained from ",["l","树液采集器","tapping"]," a ",["l","蘑菇树","Mushroom Tree"]," or from ",["l","山洞","the Farm Cave"],"."]],[1,["Forage items that are dug up with a hoe, such as the ",["l","雪山药","Snow Yam"]," and the ",["l","冬根","Winter Root"]," (in the wild)."]],[1,[["l","海草","Seaweed"],"."]]]]]],["Quality Ratios",3,[["p",["For players without the Botanist Profession, the game first tests for gold quality according to the following formula: foraging level/30. If the item fails this check, then the game tests for silver quality, according to the following formula: foraging level/15 and not gold, or (1-foraging level/30)*foraging level/15. If both checks fail, the foraged item will be of normal quality."]],["p",["The table below shows the probabilities of obtaining each quality of foraged goods. The column for the average sell price represents how much more foraged goods would be worth, relative to their base price, if they were sold individually. However, some of the seasonal foraged goods can be crafted into ",["l","打造","Wild Seeds"],", and under certain circumstances, it is more profitable to sell crafted wild seeds than it is to sell the individual items (see ",["l","春季种子","Spring Seeds"],", ",["l","夏季种子","Summer Seeds"],", ",["l","秋季种子","Fall Seeds"]," and ",["l","冬季种子","Winter Seeds"]," for details)."]],["t",[[{"h":1,"v":[["l","采集","Foraging level"]]},{"h":1,"v":["% Regular quality"]},{"h":1,"v":["% Silver quality"]},{"h":1,"v":["% Gold quality"]},{"h":1,"v":["Average price"]}],[["0"],["100%"],["0%"],["0%"],["1.00"]],[["1"],["90%"],["7%"],["3%"],["1.03"]],[["2"],["81%"],["12%"],["7%"],["1.06"]],[["3"],["72%"],["18%"],["10%"],["1.10"]],[["4"],["64%"],["23%"],["13%"],["1.12"]],[["5"],["55%"],["28%"],["17%"],["1.15"]],[["6"],["48%"],["32%"],["20%"],["1.18"]],[["7"],["41%"],["36%"],["23%"],["1.21"]],[["8"],["34%"],["39%"],["27%"],["1.23"]],[["9"],["28%"],["42%"],["30%"],["1.26"]],[["10"],["22%"],["45%"],["33%"],["1.28"]],[["11"],["17%"],["46%"],["37%"],["1.30"]],[["12"],["12%"],["48%"],["40%"],["1.32"]],[["13"],["8%"],["49%"],["43%"],["1.34"]],[["14"],["3%"],["50%"],["47%"],["1.36"]],[["15"],["0%"],["50%"],["50%"],["1.38"]]]]]],["Foraging Skill",2,[["p",["Each skill level adds +1 ",["l","斧头","Axe"]," ",["l","技能","proficiency"],". The effects of leveling up occur immediately after leveling up."]],["t",[[{"h":1,"v":["Level 1"]},{"h":1,"v":["Level 2"]},{"h":1,"v":["Level 3"]},{"h":1,"v":["Level 4"]},{"c":2,"h":1,"v":["Level 5"]}],[["Crafting Recipes:"],["Crafting Recipes:"],["Crafting / Cooking Recipes:"],["Crafting Recipes:"],{"c":2,"v":["Choose a Profession:"]}],[{"b":[["p",[["f","Spring_Seeds.png",24]," ",["l","春季种子","Wild Seeds (Sp)"],["i","(O)403","Field Snack"]]],["l",0,[[1,["Trees sometimes\ndrop seeds."]]]]]},[["i","(BC)114","Charcoal Kiln"]],[["i","(O)926","Cookout Kit"],["i","(O)MossSoup","Moss Soup"]],{"b":[["p",[["f","Summer_Seeds.png",24]," ",["l","夏季种子","Wild Seeds (Su)"],["i","(BC)105","Tapper"]," ",["i","(BC)MushroomLog","Mushroom Log"]]],["l",0,[[1,["+1 Wild Berry\nharvesting"]]]]]},[["f","Forester.png",24]," Forester\nTrees drop 25% more wood.\n(Applies to ",["l","树","Trees"],", ",["l","大树桩","Stumps"]," & ",["l","大圆木","Logs"],")"],[["f","Gatherer.png",24]," Gatherer\nChance for double harvest of foraged items.\n(20% chance of double harvest)"]],[{"h":1,"v":["Level 6"]},{"h":1,"v":["Level 7"]},{"h":1,"v":["Level 8"]},{"h":1,"v":["Level 9"]},{"c":2,"h":1,"v":["Level 10"]}],[["Crafting Recipes:"],["Crafting Recipes:"],["Crafting / Cooking Recipes:"],["Crafting Recipes:"],["Forester:"],["Gatherer:"]],[{"r":2,"v":[["i","(BC)9","Lightning Rod"],["f","Fall_Seeds.png",24]," ",["l","秋季种子","Wild Seeds (Fa)"],"\n",["f","Warp_Totem_Beach.png",24]," ",["l","传送图腾：海滩","Warp Totem:\nBeach"]]},{"r":2,"v":[["f","Winter_Seeds.png",24]," ",["l","冬季种子","Wild Seeds (Wi)"],"\n",["f","Warp_Totem_Mountains.png",24]," ",["l","传送图腾：山岭","Warp Totem:\nMountains"],"\n",["i","(O)805","Tree Fertilizer"]]},{"r":2,"v":[["i","(O)241","Survival Burger"]," ",["f","Warp_Totem_Farm.png",24]," ",["l","传送图腾：农场","Warp Totem: Farm"],"\n",["f","Tent_Kit.png",24]," ",["l","便携帐篷","Tent Kit"],"+1 Wild Berry\nharvesting"]},{"r":2,"v":[["i","(O)681","Rain Totem"]]},[["f","Lumberjack.png",24]," Lumberjack\nAll trees have a chance to drop ",["l","硬木","hardwood"],"."],[["f","Botanist.png",24]," Botanist\nForaged items are always highest quality."]],[[["f","Tapper_Icon.png",24]," Tapper\n",["l","树液采集器","Syrups"]," worth 25% more."],[["f","Tracker.png",24]," Tracker\nLocation of forageable items revealed."]]]],["g",[["Tracking.jpg",200,["Tracking arrows (right side of screen)"]]]]]],["Tracker Profession",3,[["p",["The ",["f","Tracker.png",24]," Tracker Profession makes spawned forageables in the current area easier to find. Small yellow arrows are added at the edge or corner of the screen that point towards each off-screen forageable (including inaccessible ones) and ",["l","远古斑点","artifact spot"],". A similar small green arrow points towards any off-screen shimmering lights for ",["l","淘盘","panning"],". The tracker does not indicate berry bush locations."]]]],["Experience Points",2,[["p",["Experience points (XP) are granted as follows:"]],["l",0,[[1,["14 XP for chopping down a ",["l","树","tree"]," with an axe (granted all at once for the last chop that causes the tree to fall)."]],[1,["2 XP for removing the tree stump after chopping down a tree."]],[1,["1 XP for each ",["l","农场","Twig"]," chopped down."]],[1,["1 XP for each piece of ",["l","苔藓","Moss"]," harvested from trees."]],[1,["1 XP per berry for shaking ",["l","黑莓","Blackberries"]," and ",["l","美洲大树莓","Salmonberries"]," off bushes in their respective seasons."]],[1,["25 XP for removing ",["l","大树桩","Large Stump"],"s and ",["l","大圆木","Large Log"],"s."]],[1,["7 XP for each foraged item picked up from the ground."]],[2,["If the Gatherer profession doubles the foraged item, another 7 XP is granted for the extra item."]],[1,["7 XP for each ",["l","姜","Ginger"]," harvested."]],[1,["3 XP for each ",["l","大葱","Spring Onion"]," harvested from ",["l","煤矿森林","Cindersap Forest"]," in ",["l","春季","Spring"],"."]],[1,["2 XP for items grown from ",["l","打造","Wild Seeds"]," (also 3 ",["l","耕种","Farming"]," XP)."]],[2,["If the Gatherer profession doubles the foraged item, another 2 XP is granted for the extra item."]],[1,["7 XP for each item panned from ",["l","淘盘","panning"],". For instance, if the player obtained 3 items from panning, they will receive 21 XP."]],[1,["5 XP for each mushroom collected from ",["l","山洞","the Farm Cave"]," if the mushroom option was selected, and from ",["l","蘑菇树桩","Mushroom Log"],"s."]],[1,["7 XP for each fruit collected from ",["l","山洞","the Farm Cave"]," if the fruit bats option was selected."]],[1,["15 XP for digging up a ",["l","绿色斑点","Seed Spot"]," or ",["l","远古斑点","Artifact Spot"],"."]],[1,["15 XP for destroying a large ",["l","天气","Green Rain"]," ",["l","杂草","weed"],"."]],[1,["250 XP for reading a copy of the ",["l","樵夫周刊","Woodcutter's Weekly"]," or ",["l","星之书","Book Of Stars"],"."]]]],["p",["The 7 XP for foraging items applies solely to those items visible sitting on the ground that are picked up only if the player clicks on them; it does not apply to items lying on the ground (e.g., dropped by shaking) that are automatically added to the player inventory by ",["l","磁性","magnetism"],". Specific items that do grant 7 XP include:"]],["l",0,[[1,["Standard randomly-spawned foraged items throughout Stardew Valley and Calico Desert."]],[1,["All items foraged from ",["l","沙滩","the Beach"]," and ",["l","姜岛","the west side of Ginger Island"],"."]],[1,["All fruit collected from ",["l","山洞","the Farm Cave"],", if the fruit bat option was selected."]],[1,["All mushrooms collected from the ",["l","姜岛","Ginger Island Mushroom Cave"],"."]],[1,[["l","松露","Truffle"],"s."]],[1,["Forage items spawned on the ground in ",["l","矿井","the Mines"]," and ",["l","骷髅洞穴","Skull Cavern"],", namely ",["l","红蘑菇","Red Mushroom"],"s, ",["l","紫蘑菇","Purple Mushroom"],"s, and ",["l","蕨菜","Fiddlehead Fern"],"s."]]]],["p",["The following Items do NOT grant any foraging experience:"]],["l",0,[[1,["Trees or ",["l","农场","twigs"]," felled by ",["l","打造","Bombs"]," (however, weakening a tree with bombs before felling it with an axe will still give full XP)."]],[1,["Stage 4 ",["l","农场","tree seedlings"]," chopped down by the player"]],[1,[["l","葡萄","Grape"],"s grown from ",["l","葡萄种子","Grape Starter"],"s (grants ",["l","耕种","Farming"]," XP instead)."]],[1,["Items grown in ",["l","花盆","Garden Pot"],"s."]],[1,["Items dug up by tilling soil in ",["l","矿井","the Mines"]," or ",["l","骷髅洞穴","Skull Cavern"]," (e.g., ",["l","山洞萝卜","Cave Carrot"],")"]],[1,["Mushrooms obtained from chopping or tapping a ",["l","蘑菇树","Mushroom Tree"],"."]],[1,["Non-forage items spawned on the ground in ",["l","矿井","the Mines"]," and ",["l","骷髅洞穴","Skull Cavern"],", namely ",["l","石英","Quartz"],", ",["l","地晶","Earth Crystal"],"s, ",["l","泪晶","Frozen Tear"],"s, ",["l","火水晶","Fire Quartz"],", and ",["l","恐龙蛋","Dinosaur Egg"],"s -- except that a bug causes any duplicates created by the Gatherer profession to give 7 XP."]],[1,["Forageables obtained from killing ",["l","怪物","Monsters"],"."]]]]]],["Food",2,[["p",["Certain ",["l","烹饪","cooked dishes"]," will temporarily increase foraging level. ",["l","齐氏调味料","Qi Seasoning"]," can be applied to further increase the stat buff. This is useful for increasing ",["l","斧头","Axe"]," proficiency, or for harvesting more berries from each bush during ",["l","美洲大树莓","Salmonberry"]," or ",["l","黑莓","Blackberry"]," season (up to a maximum of 4 berries can be harvested with Foraging level 12-13)."]],["t",[[{"h":1,"v":["Name"]},{"h":1,"v":["Description"]},{"h":1,"v":["Ingredients"]},{"h":1,"v":["Energy / Health"]},{"h":1,"v":["Buff(s)"]},{"h":1,"v":["Buff Duration"]},{"h":1,"v":["Recipe Source(s)"]},{"h":1,"v":["Sell Price"]}],[[["l","薄煎饼","Pancakes"]],["A double stack of fluffy, soft pancakes."],[["i","(O)246","Wheat Flour ×1"],["i","(O)176","Egg ×1"]],["Energy 90\nHealth 40"],[["l","采集","Foraging (+2)"]],["11m 11s"],["The Queen of Sauce (14 Summer, Year 1)\n ",["f","Gus_Icon.png",22]," ",["l","星之果实酒吧","Stardrop Saloon"]," for 100g"],["80g"]],[[["l","秋日恩赐","Autumn's Bounty"]],["A taste of the season."],[["i","(O)280","Yam ×1"],["i","(O)276","Pumpkin ×1"]],["Energy 220\nHealth 99"],[["l","采集","Foraging (+2)"],["l","防御","Defense (+2)"]],["7m 41s"],[["l","德米特里厄斯","Demetrius"]," (Mail - 7+ ❤)"],["350g"]],[[["l","救生汉堡","Survival Burger"]],["A convenient snack for the explorer."],[["i","(O)216","Bread ×1"],["i","(O)78","Cave Carrot ×1"],["i","(O)272","Eggplant ×1"]],["Energy 125\nHealth 56"],[["l","采集","Foraging (+3)"]],["5m 35s"],[["f","Foraging_Skill_Icon.png",24]," ",["l","采集","Foraging"]," Level 8"],["180g"]],[[["l","热带咖喱","Tropical Curry"]],["An exotic, fragrant curry served in a pineapple bowl."],[["i","(O)88","Coconut ×1"],["i","(O)832","Pineapple ×1"],["i","(O)260","Hot Pepper ×1"]],["Energy 150\nHealth 67"],[["l","采集","Foraging (+4)"]],["5m 1s"],[["f","Gus_Icon.png",24]," ",["l","姜岛","Ginger Island Resort"]," for 2,000g"],["500g"]]]]]],["Spawning",2,[["p",["New forageable items can potentially spawn (appear) overnight on any exterior map. This section describes the rules used to spawn all typical forageable items. However, specialized items are handled differently and are described on their individual pages, namely ",["l","大葱","Spring Onion"],"s in ",["l","煤矿森林","Cindersap Forest"],"; ",["l","珊瑚","Coral"],", ",["l","海胆","Sea Urchin"],"s and ",["l","海草","Seaweed"]," at ",["l","沙滩","the Beach"],"; fruit in ",["l","山洞","the Farm Cave"],"; all forageables on the ",["l","农场地图","Forest Farm Map"],". Also, ",["l","美洲大树莓","Salmonberry"]," bushes, ",["l","黑莓","Blackberry"]," bushes, ",["l","冬根","Winter Root"],"s, and ",["l","雪山药","Snow Yam"],"s don't spawn individual items."]],["p",["There is a hard limit of six standard forageable items per map (i.e., areas bounded by screen transitions) per week, reset on Sundays. Picking forageables does not reduce the weekly counter, so there is little-to-no advantage in picking forageables before Saturday (the day before the reset)."]],["p",["Only a subset of all the tiles on each map are valid spawning locations. On most maps, forageable items can spawn only on the green (grassy-type) tiles, and only on certain specific types of green tiles. ",["l","沙滩","The Beach"]," and ",["l","沙漠","the Desert"]," are exceptions, where spawning is possible on most yellow (sandy-type) tiles. Items never spawn in occupied locations (trees, chests, weeds, sticks, stones, etc.). They also never spawn in hidden tiles behind buildings, bushes, non-removable trees, or other permanent features. They can spawn behind removable trees (ones that can be chopped down; they also turn semi-transparent when the player walks behind them), but the spawn rate is 90% smaller in about half of the tiles behind a tree."]],["p",["Therefore, the fraction of valid tiles differs for every map, which directly affects the chance of items spawning on each map. It is also affected by the player's actions. Removing debris (weeds, etc.) and chopping down trees can increase the number of valid tiles, whereas placing equipment (chests, etc.) may decrease the number. Planting trees can also have an effect: even though (on most maps) trees can be planted only in tiles where forage items can't spawn, they reduce the spawn chance in some tiles behind the tree (and also make it hard to find items that do spawn). However, these effects are generally small, unless a large fraction of the map tiles is occupied. All spawn rates are calculated assuming the default trees are in place and fully grown, but that all other tiles are cleared."]],["p",["All uncollected forageable items are removed from the map overnight before Sunday morning and before the first day of a season. This cleanup applies both to standard forageable items and nearly all specialized items (fruit in ",["l","山洞","the Farm Cave"]," is the only known exception). Even non-season-specific items are removed at the start of a new season. To help repopulate the map, the chances of new items spawning are slightly higher on these days."]],["p",["Forageable items will be destroyed if they are in the path of a ",["l","居民","villager"],"."]]]],["Foraged Items",2,[["p",["Where percentages are provided for locations in the following tables, they represent the percentage of all foraged items spawned in that location that will (on average) be the specified item."]]]],["Basic",3,[["t",[[{"h":1,"v":["Image"]},{"h":1,"v":["Name"]},{"h":1,"v":["Found"]},{"h":1,"v":["Sell Price"]},{"h":1,"v":["Energy / Health"]},{"h":1,"v":["Used In"]}],[[["f","Sap.png",48]],[["l","树液","Sap"]],["Wherever there are ",["l","树","trees"]," that can be chopped down"],["2g"],["Energy -5\nHealth 0"],[["i","(O)368","Basic Fertilizer"],["i","(O)885","Fiber Seeds"],["i","(O)877","Quality Bobber"],["i","(O)369","Quality Fertilizer"],["i","(BC)StatueOfBlessings","Statue Of Blessings"],["i","(O)694","Trap Bobber"],["i","(O)93","Torch"]]]]]]],["Spring",3,[["t",[[{"h":1,"v":["Image"]},{"h":1,"v":["Name"]},{"h":1,"v":["Found"]},{"h":1,"v":["Sell Price"]},{"h":1,"v":["Energy / Health"]},{"h":1,"v":["Used In"]}],[[["f","Common_Mushroom.png",48]],[["l","普通蘑菇","Common Mushroom"]],{"b":[["l",0,[[1,[["l","秘密森林","Secret Woods"]," (16%)"]],[1,[["l","山洞","Farm Cave"]," (Mushroom option)"]]]]]},["40g"],["Energy 38\nHealth 17"],["Crafts Room",["i","(O)497","Fall Seeds"],["i","(O)205","Fried Mushroom"],["i","(O)606","Stir Fry"],["i","(O)218","Tom Kha Soup"],["i","(O)DriedMushrooms/404","Dried Mushrooms"],"Pickles"]],[[["f","Daffodil.